      "sourceText": "| 标志参数             | 简记 | 作用               |\n| :--------------- | :- | :--------------- |\n| `COLOR_BGR2BGRA` | 0  | 对RGB图像添加alpha通道  |\n| `COLOR_BGR2RGB`  | 4  | 彩色图像通道颜色顺序的更改    |\n| `COLOR_BGR2GRAY` | 10 | 彩色图像转成灰度图像       |\n| `COLOR_GRAY2BGR` | 8  | 灰度图像转成彩色图像（伪彩色）  |\n| `COLOR_BGR2YUV`  | 82 | RGB颜色模型转成YUV颜色模型 |\n| `COLOR_YUV2BGR`  | 84 | YUV颜色模型转成RGB颜色模型 |\n| `COLOR_BGR2HSV`  | 40 | RGB颜色模型转成HSV颜色模型 |\n| `COLOR_HSV2BGR`  | 54 | HSV颜色模型转成RGB颜色模型 |\n| `COLOR_BGR2Lab`  | 44 | RGB颜色模型转成Lab颜色模型 |\n| `COLOR_Lab2BGR`  | 56 | Lab颜色模型转成RGB颜色模型 |",
      "translatedText": "| Flag parameter             | Abbreviation | Function               |\n| :--------------- | :- | :--------------- |\n| `COLOR_BGR2BGRA` | 0  | Add an alpha channel to an RGB image  |\n| `COLOR_BGR2RGB`  | 4  | Change the color channel order of a color image    |\n| `COLOR_BGR2GRAY` | 10 | Convert a color image to a grayscale image       |\n| `COLOR_GRAY2BGR` | 8  | Convert a grayscale image to a color image (pseudocolor)  |\n| `COLOR_BGR2YUV`  | 82 | Convert the RGB color model to the YUV color model |\n| `COLOR_YUV2BGR`  | 84 | Convert the YUV color model to the RGB color model |\n| `COLOR_BGR2HSV`  | 40 | Convert the RGB color model to the HSV color model |\n| `COLOR_HSV2BGR`  | 54 | Convert the HSV color model to the RGB color model |\n| `COLOR_BGR2Lab`  | 44 | Convert the RGB color model to the Lab color model |\n| `COLOR_Lab2BGR`  | 56 | Convert the Lab color model to the RGB color model |",
